          "basis": "",
          "command": "tensward analyse --project /p/lf8 --engine-arg max-num-seqs=16 --goal ttft",
          "costs": "trade-off: TPOT worsens (more sequences share each step); TPOT rises as more sequences share each step; more KV cache in use",
